    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUBE is a minimalist tower defense Roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Background]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only one who can operate the tower! Stay nearby to keep it powered up to destroy the hordes of enemies trying to knock it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining the elements of minimalist tower defense + Roguelike, a unique gaming experience is created</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Upgrade the tower, upgrade yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the comfort of the tower to collect resources to upgrade the tower, weapons, and players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Upgrade enemies! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave, you must choose which enemies to face next and how to upgrade them. If you want to succeed, you must choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Survive? Survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter an indescribable BOSS later, please don't be afraid.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUBE is a minimalist tower defense Roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Background]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only one who can operate the tower! Stay nearby to keep it powered up to destroy the hordes of enemies trying to knock it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining the elements of minimalist tower defense + Roguelike, a unique gaming experience is created</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Upgrade the tower, upgrade yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the comfort of the tower to collect resources to upgrade the tower, weapons, and players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Upgrade enemies! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave, you must choose which enemies to face next and how to upgrade them. If you want to succeed, you must choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Survive? Survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter an indescribable BOSS later, please don't be afraid.</p>",
